was nothing more...

[color=red]than a failed...[/color]

Sage: Father wait...

Sage: ...Don't leave...

Sage: ...I'm sorry... [color=red]we never found you...[/color]

Sage: I'm so sorry I hurt you...

Sage: I'm so sorry for being such a [color=red]failure.[/color]

Sage: I mess up really really bad Father and when we head to bed something horrible happens...

